  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\">這個簡單的Minecraft模組在平原和櫻花林生態域中增加了亞洲風味餐車。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">在餐車內，你會遇到村民Hiro（ヒロ）。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">本模組還新增兩種食物：鮭魚握壽司和白蘿蔔。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/357/food-cart.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"373\" height=\"210\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/360/new-food.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"379\" height=\"213\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>歡迎將本模組用於您的模組包中</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">餐車建造教學：</span></strong></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:417px;display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hUZ6QkDKZz4\" width=\"417\" height=\"242\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
